    <div class="socratic">
        <h3>Socratic: Three ways to make a number survive</h3>
        <p>All three are real Unity techniques. Compare what each one costs you:</p>
        <table>
            <tr><th>Approach</th><th>How it works</th><th>What it costs</th></tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>A <code>static</code> field</strong></td>
                <td>The field belongs to the <em>class</em>, not to any object, so destroying the objects does not touch it.</td>
